          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Compatibility</span></span><br>\nThe passer is validated to fit through Stryker's DriLok 5.0mm cannula and can reliably pass Stryker's suture tape: sizes #2-0 to 1.4mm suture tape.</p>\n",
